briefs.borrows:
The lineage's first language, from its own donors:
- L219 terminus rings (Signal Box; H/tour/donors/variants/r7-idea-2/templates/_ui.html L37-62);
- L239 Sign in and 404 as the two ends of a line (r7-idea-2 login.html, 404.html, palette css in H/tour/donors/palettes/r7-idea-2.json);
- Signal Box's fortnight plates hung under the stops, with 'All plans →' at the end of the line;
- L243 the head bracket that gathers controls (Signal Lines; H/tour/donors/variants/r9-idea-4/src/lines.css .masthead rules, templates ideas.html/tasks.html/plans.html);
- L209 chat branch ticks and a lit terminus (lines.css .in-chat .said-them::after, .your-turn);
- L210 lines only for sequence: the setup stations and the fallback chain (lines.css .setup-list.track, templates/setup.html, status.html .chain).
Their judges' fixes applied:
- keep ticks square and never a lamp (usability, skeptic, interaction r9);
- no form in the bracket (system and feedback r9);
- no ring or drop on heads with nothing to hold, and no buffer stops read as pins (system, interaction, style r9);
- a latched cell for 'here', not a 5px dot (interaction and skeptic r9);
- square the drop so it stops reading as a subway map (skeptic r7);
- end every rail on its last lamp or a real buffer (all lenses r7);
- 'Add an idea' on the title baseline (all lenses r7);
- family on the right with their time beside the bubble (r7, skeptic r10);
- hide the chat track below 40rem (interaction r9);
- slate instead of the olive tray (skeptic r10-r13);
- the light on the live list from Aglow (feedback and soul r13);
- words in the bar (feedback r12, interaction/usability r11-r13);
- late in words on To do via the in-template clock of H/tour/t1-a/variants/r13-idea-1/templates/tasks.html (usability r10-r13);
- thin cases (feedback r11/r13).

L033, two-track tape chat (a gem; Braun Signal, r10-wild-1, 5.48, #16 of 19): H/rounds/r10/variants/r10-wild-1/templates/_ui.html chat_line (L96+) and waiting_line; sheet.css .thread > li, .tape-time, bubbles (~1380-1440), phone (1999-2003). It becomes Chat's double-track main line.

L143, Status lamp strip with its tally (a gem; Single Quote, r12-wild-4, 6.59, #11 of 17): H/rounds/r12/variants/r12-wild-4/templates/status.html L63-64; sheet.css L1531-1536. It becomes the indication panel, banked and linked.

L063, distance dial on Ideas (a gem; Braun Signal, r10-wild-1): H/rounds/r10/variants/r10-wild-1/templates/ideas.html L9-48; _ui.html dial L160-213; sheet.css .dial ~978-1010. It becomes 'the line from home', on a square-root scale with staggered station numbers.

L145, busy days on the month (a gem; Signal Catalogue, r13-wild-2, 5.71, #17 of 17): H/rounds/r13/variants/r13-wild-2/sheet.css L2113-2135, static/pulse.svg. It becomes week rails with plan lamps and the lit NOW run.

Free universal fixes taken:
- 44px targets and sentence-case controls and links;
- late in amber words;
- tabular figures;
- underlined links;
- one control per filter;
- a strong 'here' (L186's backlit steel key, Signal Legend Relit, H/rounds/r10/palettes/r10-mut-5.json).

The lineage's most important fixes:
- the light on the live list (feedback and soul r10-r13, Aglow's own files);
- slate setup (skeptic r10-r13);
- kind tints off (feedback r10/r11/r13);
- words in the bar (feedback r12, interaction and usability r11-r13);
- thin cases (feedback r11/r13);
- Lately added without rail (system r10);
- the late flag on To do (usability r10-r13).
